---
// Four files that import each other form one tangle (a strongly connected
// component) containing three loops; jscycles reports one of them. The graph
// matches the example on the "How it works" page, checked with the CLI.
---

<figure class="tangle not-content">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 460 240" role="img" aria-labelledby="tangle-title tangle-desc">
    <title id="tangle-title">One tangle of four files</title>
    <desc id="tangle-desc">
      a.ts imports b.ts; b.ts imports c.ts and d.ts; c.ts imports a.ts and b.ts; d.ts imports b.ts and
      e.ts. a, b, c and d form one tangle with three loops: a to b to c to a, b to c to b, and b to d to
      b. e.ts is outside the tangle. jscycles reports the loop a to b to c to a.
    </desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="tangle-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" class="muted-fill"></path>
      </marker>
      <marker id="tangle-arrow-hot" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" class="hot-fill"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <path
      class="region"
      d="M 42 36 H 424 Q 434 36 434 46 V 100 Q 434 110 424 110 H 262 Q 252 110 246 118 L 194 212 Q 188 222 178 222 H 122 Q 112 222 106 213 L 36 106 Q 32 100 32 92 V 46 Q 32 36 42 36 Z"
    ></path>

    <g class="edges">
      <line x1="218.4" y1="96.1" x2="172.5" y2="159.2" class="hot"></line>
      <line x1="133.5" y1="157.3" x2="87.6" y2="94.3" class="hot"></line>
      <line x1="98" y1="70" x2="200" y2="70" class="hot"></line>
      <line x1="161.6" y1="153.8" x2="207.5" y2="90.8"></line>
      <line x1="258" y1="63" x2="360" y2="63"></line>
      <line x1="362" y1="77" x2="260" y2="77"></line>
      <line x1="390" y1="98" x2="390" y2="152"></line>
    </g>

    <g class="nodes">
      <circle cx="70" cy="70" r="26" class="in"></circle><text x="70" y="70">a.ts</text>
      <circle cx="230" cy="70" r="26" class="in"></circle><text x="230" y="70">b.ts</text>
      <circle cx="150" cy="180" r="26" class="in"></circle><text x="150" y="180">c.ts</text>
      <circle cx="390" cy="70" r="26" class="in"></circle><text x="390" y="70">d.ts</text>
      <circle cx="390" cy="180" r="26"></circle><text x="390" y="180">e.ts</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    <span class="key key-region" aria-hidden="true"></span> One tangle: four files, three overlapping loops.
    <span class="key key-hot" aria-hidden="true"></span> The loop jscycles reports:{' '}
    <code>a.ts → b.ts → c.ts → a.ts</code>. <code>e.ts</code> is imported but loops back to nothing.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .tangle {
    --tangle-hot: #c2410c;
    --tangle-muted: hsl(224, 6%, 56%);
    margin-block: 1.5rem;
  }
  :global(:root:not([data-theme='light'])) .tangle {
    --tangle-hot: #e4630f;
  }
  svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 30rem;
    height: auto;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  .region {
    fill: var(--sl-color-accent-low);
    opacity: 0.55;
  }
  .edges line {
    stroke: var(--tangle-muted);
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    marker-end: url(#tangle-arrow);
  }
  .edges line.hot {
    stroke: var(--tangle-hot);
    stroke-width: 3;
    marker-end: url(#tangle-arrow-hot);
  }
  .muted-fill {
    fill: var(--tangle-muted);
  }
  .hot-fill {
    fill: var(--tangle-hot);
  }
  .nodes circle {
    fill: var(--sl-color-bg);
    stroke: var(--tangle-muted);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }
  .nodes text {
    fill: var(--sl-color-white);
    font: 600 12px var(--sl-font-system-mono, ui-monospace, monospace);
    text-anchor: middle;
    dominant-baseline: central;
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .key {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 0.9em;
    height: 0.9em;
    border-radius: 3px;
    vertical-align: -0.1em;
    margin-inline: 0.5em 0.25em;
  }
  .key-region {
    background: var(--sl-color-accent-low);
  }
  .key-hot {
    background: var(--tangle-hot);
    height: 0.25em;
    vertical-align: 0.2em;
  }
  figcaption code {
    font-family: var(--__sl-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9em;
    background: var(--sl-color-bg-inline-code);
    padding: 0.1em 0.3em;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  figcaption a {
    color: var(--sl-color-text-accent);
  }
</style>
